---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import content from '../../i18n/de/install';

const lang = 'de';
---

<Layout
  title="Download & Install — CIPHER-MUX"
  description={content.hero.body}
  lang={lang}
  active="download"
>
  <div class="install-page">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="install-hero">
      <div class="install-kicker">Get started</div>
      <h1>Vom Mac zum Cockpit.<br/><span class="accent">~20 Minuten.</span> Einmalig.</h1>
      <p class="install-hero-body">{content.hero.body}</p>

      <!-- Phase strip -->
      <div class="phase-strip">
        {[
          { n: '01', label: 'Installation', time: '~10 min' },
          { n: '02', label: 'Erster Start', time: '~5 min' },
          { n: '03', label: 'Erstes Ergebnis', time: '~5\u201310 min' },
          { n: '04', label: 'Weiter', time: 'wann du willst' },
        ].map((p) => (
          <div class="phase-strip-box">
            <div class="phase-strip-num">PHASE {p.n}</div>
            <div class="phase-strip-label">{p.label}</div>
            <div class="phase-strip-time">{p.time}</div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <!-- DMG Download CTA -->
      <div class="dmg-cta">
        <a href="#" class="dmg-btn">&darr; cipher-mux-0.9.0.dmg</a>
        <span class="dmg-meta">macOS &middot; Apple Silicon &middot; 142 MB &middot; SHA-256 verifiziert</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Honest disclosure -->
      <div class="disclosure-box">
        <div class="disclosure-label">Ehrlich gesagt</div>
        <p>Phase 1 verlangt Terminal-Befehle. Nicht weil wir&apos;s hipster finden, sondern weil Claude Code CLI Voraussetzung ist und sich nicht per Klick installiert. Wir f&uuml;hren dich Schritt f&uuml;r Schritt durch &mdash; copy/paste reicht.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Phase 01 -->
    <section id="phase1" class="install-phase">
      <div class="phase-header">
        <span class="phase-header-num">01 &middot; Installation</span>
        <span class="phase-time">~10 min &middot; einmalig</span>
      </div>
      <h2>{content.phases[0].title}</h2>
      <p class="install-lead">{content.phases[0].lead}</p>

      <!-- Step A -->
      <div class="step-block">
        <div class="step-badge-row">
          <div class="step-badge">A</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Claude Code CLI installieren</h3>
            <p class="step-desc">Voraussetzung &mdash; ohne Claude Code l&auml;uft nichts. Wenn npm bereits da ist, ist&apos;s ein Einzeiler.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cm-terminal">
          <div class="cm-terminal-bar">
            <span class="cm-terminal-dot" style="background:#FF5F57"></span>
            <span class="cm-terminal-dot" style="background:#FEBC2E"></span>
            <span class="cm-terminal-dot" style="background:#28C840"></span>
            <span class="cm-terminal-title">Terminal &middot; Spotlight &rarr; Terminal</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cm-terminal-body">
            <div class="t-comment"># Falls du bereits npm hast &mdash; direkt los:</div>
            <div class="t-cmd"><span class="t-prompt">$</span> npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code</div>
            <div class="t-spacer"></div>
            <div class="t-comment"># Sonst zuerst Homebrew installieren:</div>
            <div class="t-cmd"><span class="t-prompt">$</span> /bin/bash -c &quot;$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/install/HEAD/install.sh)&quot;</div>
            <div class="t-out">=&gt; Installation successful!</div>
            <div class="t-spacer"></div>
            <div class="t-comment"># Dann Node &mdash; bringt npm mit:</div>
            <div class="t-cmd"><span class="t-prompt">$</span> brew install node</div>
            <div class="t-spacer"></div>
            <div class="t-comment"># Und jetzt Claude Code:</div>
            <div class="t-cmd"><span class="t-prompt">$</span> npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code</div>
            <div class="t-out">+ @anthropic-ai/claude-code@1.x.x</div>
            <div class="t-spacer"></div>
            <div class="t-comment"># Pr&uuml;fen + erstmalig starten (Login im Browser):</div>
            <div class="t-cmd"><span class="t-prompt">$</span> claude --version</div>
            <div class="t-out">claude-code 1.x.x</div>
            <div class="t-cmd"><span class="t-prompt">$</span> claude</div>
            <div class="t-out">&rarr; Browser &ouml;ffnet sich, einloggen, Tab schlie&szlig;t sich.</div>
            <div class="t-out">&rarr; CLI ist autorisiert. Strg+C zum Beenden.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pitfall-card">
          <div class="pitfall-label">&#9888; Stolperstellen</div>
          <ul>
            <li>Du brauchst einen Anthropic-Account (Free/Pro/Max). Anlegen unter claude.ai bevor du startest.</li>
            <li>Beim ersten brew-Aufruf installiert macOS die Xcode Command Line Tools &mdash; das dauert ca. 5 Minuten. Geduld.</li>
            <li>Wenn npm install -g eine Permission-Warnung wirft, mit sudo nachschie&szlig;en: <code>sudo npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code</code></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step B -->
      <div class="step-block">
        <div class="step-badge-row">
          <div class="step-badge">B</div>
          <div>
            <h3>CIPHER-MUX installieren</h3>
            <p class="step-desc">Standard-DMG-Flow. tmux ist mitgeliefert &mdash; du musst nichts mehr im Terminal anfassen.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="dmg-flow-grid">
          <div class="dmg-steps-box">
            <ol class="dmg-steps">
              <li>
                <span class="dmg-step-num">1</span>
                <div><strong>DMG &ouml;ffnen</strong><br/>Doppelklick auf cipher-mux-0.9.0.dmg</div>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="dmg-step-num">2</span>
                <div><strong>In Applications ziehen</strong><br/>Standard-macOS-Drag-and-Drop</div>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="dmg-step-num">3</span>
                <div><strong>Erster Start: Rechtsklick &rarr; &Ouml;ffnen</strong><br/>Wegen Gatekeeper bei unsignierter App. Einmalig.</div>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="dmg-step-num">4</span>
                <div><strong>Berechtigungen erteilen</strong><br/>Accessibility (f&uuml;r globale Shortcuts) &middot; evtl. Mikrofon (f&uuml;r Voice)</div>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>
          <div class="dmg-mock">
            <div class="dmg-mock-chrome">
              <span class="cm-terminal-dot" style="background:#FF5F57"></span>
              <span class="cm-terminal-dot" style="background:#FEBC2E"></span>
              <span class="cm-terminal-dot" style="background:#28C840"></span>
              <span class="dmg-mock-title">cipher-mux-0.9.0</span>
            </div>
            <div class="dmg-mock-body">
              <div class="dmg-mock-icon">CM</div>
              <div class="dmg-mock-arrow">&rarr;</div>
              <div class="dmg-mock-target">A</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pitfall-card">
          <div class="pitfall-label">&#9888; Stolperstellen</div>
          <ul>
            <li>Beim ersten Start blockiert Gatekeeper &mdash; Rechtsklick &rarr; &Ouml;ffnen &rarr; Best&auml;tigen. Danach normaler Doppelklick.</li>
            <li>Accessibility-Berechtigung muss in Systemeinstellungen &rarr; Datenschutz aktiv geschaltet werden.</li>
            <li>tmux wird intern mitgeliefert &mdash; du musst nichts manuell installieren.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Phase 02 -->
    <section id="phase2" class="install-phase">
      <div class="phase-header">
        <span class="phase-header-num">02 &middot; Erster Start</span>
        <span class="phase-time">~5 min</span>
      </div>
      <h2>{content.phases[1].title}</h2>
      <p class="install-lead">{content.phases[1].lead}</p>

      <div class="companion-grid">
        <!-- Left: Companion mock -->
        <div class="companion-mock">
          <div class="companion-mock-header">
            <span><span class="accent">●</span> companion &middot; cell 1/1</span>
            <span>relay</span>
          </div>
          <div class="companion-mock-body">
            <div class="companion-name">relay &#9656;</div>
            <div class="companion-msg">Hey! Ich bin dein Guide. Kurz drei Fragen, dann legen wir los.</div>

            <div class="companion-q"># Frage 1</div>
            <div class="companion-qlabel">Coding-Hintergrund?</div>
            <div class="companion-opts">
              <span>Keiner</span>
              <span class="companion-opt--active">Etwas &#10003;</span>
              <span>Viel</span>
            </div>

            <div class="companion-q"># Frage 2</div>
            <div class="companion-qlabel">KI-Erfahrung?</div>
            <div class="companion-opts">
              <span>Nie</span>
              <span>ChatGPT etc.</span>
              <span class="companion-opt--active">Claude Code &#10003;</span>
            </div>

            <div class="companion-q"># Frage 3</div>
            <div class="companion-qlabel">Was willst du bauen?</div>
            <div class="companion-input">Erstmal gucken &mdash; vielleicht ein paar Notizen-Tools_</div>

            <div class="companion-confirm">&#10003; user-profile.json erstellt</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Narrative -->
        <div class="companion-narrative">
          <div class="companion-narrative-title">So l&auml;uft&apos;s ab</div>
          <ol class="companion-steps">
            <li><span class="companion-step-n">1</span><div><strong>App &ouml;ffnet &rarr; leeres Grid</strong><br/>Ein 1&times;1 Layout zur Begr&uuml;&szlig;ung. Keine Reiz&uuml;berflutung.</div></li>
            <li><span class="companion-step-n">2</span><div><strong>Companion-Cell vorbelegt</strong><br/>Der Companion &mdash; standardm&auml;ssig Relay &mdash; &uuml;bernimmt die erste Cell.</div></li>
            <li><span class="companion-step-n">3</span><div><strong>Drei kurze Fragen</strong><br/>Coding-Erfahrung, KI-Vorwissen, Vorhaben. Speichert ein Profil.</div></li>
            <li><span class="companion-step-n">4</span><div><strong>Sprache passt sich an</strong><br/>Companion redet jetzt auf deinem Level. Kein Tech-Jargon ohne Grund.</div></li>
            <li><span class="companion-step-n">5</span><div><strong>Erstes Projekt &ouml;ffnen</strong><br/>Pfad eingeben oder Demo-Projekt nehmen. Claude Code startet in der Cell.</div></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Phase 03 -->
    <section id="phase3" class="install-phase">
      <div class="phase-header">
        <span class="phase-header-num">03 &middot; Erstes Ergebnis</span>
        <span class="phase-time">~5&ndash;10 min</span>
      </div>
      <h2>{content.phases[2].title}</h2>
      <p class="install-lead">{content.phases[2].lead}</p>

      <div class="actions-grid">
        <div class="action-card">
          <div class="action-num">AKTION 01</div>
          <h3>Etwas tippen</h3>
          <p>Gib Claude einen einfachen Auftrag in der ersten Cell. Du siehst: er arbeitet, Output erscheint im Terminal.</p>
          <div class="action-mini-grid"><div class="action-mini-cell action-mini-cell--active">CC &#9656;</div></div>
          <div class="action-terminal"><span class="accent">&#8250;</span> Erkl&auml;r mir was in diesem Projekt passiert</div>
        </div>
        <div class="action-card">
          <div class="action-num">AKTION 02</div>
          <h3>Zweite Session</h3>
          <p>Spalte hinzuf&uuml;gen, neue Session &ouml;ffnen. Zwei parallele Claude-Cells. Das Kernfeature.</p>
          <div class="action-mini-grid" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr"><div class="action-mini-cell action-mini-cell--active">CC &#9656;</div><div class="action-mini-cell action-mini-cell--active">CC &#9656;</div></div>
          <div class="action-terminal"><span class="dim"># Shortcut</span><br/><span class="accent">&#8984; + &rarr;</span> f&uuml;gt Spalte rechts hinzu</div>
        </div>
        <div class="action-card">
          <div class="action-num">AKTION 03</div>
          <h3>Sidebar entdecken</h3>
          <p>Sidebar &ouml;ffnen, Notes-Tab &ouml;ffnen, erste Notiz schreiben. Memory ist hier zuhause.</p>
          <div class="action-sidebar-mock">
            <div class="action-sidebar-left">NOTES</div>
            <div class="action-sidebar-right">CC &#9656;</div>
          </div>
          <div class="action-terminal"><span class="dim"># Shortcut</span><br/><span class="accent">&#8984; + B</span> schaltet Sidebar um</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="outcome-strip">
        <div class="outcome-label">Nach diesen drei Aktionen hast du</div>
        <div class="outcome-items">
          <span>&#10003; Claude Code l&auml;uft</span>
          <span>&#10003; Zwei parallele Sessions</span>
          <span>&#10003; Grid &middot; Cells &middot; Focus verstanden</span>
          <span>&#10003; Sidebar + Notes gefunden</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Phase 04 -->
    <section id="phase4" class="install-phase">
      <div class="phase-header">
        <span class="phase-header-num">04 &middot; Weiter</span>
        <span class="phase-time">wann du willst</span>
      </div>
      <h2>Der Companion schl&auml;gt vor &mdash; du w&auml;hlst</h2>
      <p class="install-lead">Je nach Skill-Level hat die Companion verschiedene n&auml;chste Schritte. Kein Druck &mdash; du kannst auch einfach machen.</p>

      <div class="nextstep-grid">
        <div class="nextstep-card">
          <span class="nextstep-guide">Guide 02</span>
          <div class="nextstep-tag">Einsteiger</div>
          <h4>Voice + Notes</h4>
          <p>Morgen zeig ich dir Voice Input und wie du Notes als zweites Ged&auml;chtnis nutzt.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="nextstep-card">
          <span class="nextstep-guide">Guide 03</span>
          <div class="nextstep-tag">Fortgeschritten</div>
          <h4>Workshop</h4>
          <p>Wenn du magst, zeig ich dir den Workshop &mdash; wie mehrere Sessions zusammenarbeiten.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="nextstep-card">
          <span class="nextstep-guide">Guide 03 + 05</span>
          <div class="nextstep-tag">Power-User</div>
          <h4>MPO + Prompting</h4>
          <p>Du wei&szlig;t was du tust. Orchestrierung und Prompt-Design wenn du tiefer rein willst.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Bottom CTA -->
    <section class="install-bottom">
      <h2>Bereit? <span class="accent">Lad&apos;s runter.</span></h2>
      <p>Apple Silicon empfohlen. Intel-Macs funktionieren &mdash; ohne Ollama-Integration. Linux &amp; Windows: kommt.</p>
      <div class="install-bottom-actions">
        <a href="#" class="dmg-btn">&darr; DMG &middot; Apple Silicon</a>
        <a href="#" class="dmg-btn dmg-btn--outline">&darr; DMG &middot; Intel (no Ollama)</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/cmarkus42/cipher-mux-electron" class="install-link">github / cipher-mux &#8599;</a>
        <a href={`/${lang}/docs`} class="install-link">docs &#8599;</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .install-page {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 64px;
  }
  .accent { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .dim { color: var(--color-text-dim); }

  /* Hero */
  .install-hero {
    padding: 120px 0 48px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .install-kicker {
    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .install-hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 76px);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }
  .install-hero-body {
    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 0 36px;
  }

  /* Phase strip */
  .phase-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
    max-width: 920px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .phase-strip-box {
    background: var(--color-bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 14px 14px 12px;
    clip-path: polygon(10px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 10px), calc(100% - 10px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 10px);
  }
  .phase-strip-num {
    font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .phase-strip-label {
    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .phase-strip-time {
    font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.8px;
  }

  /* DMG CTA */
  .dmg-cta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 36px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .dmg-btn {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-bg);
    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    display: inline-block;
    text-decoration: none;
    clip-path: polygon(10px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 10px), calc(100% - 10px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 10px);
  }
  .dmg-btn:hover { text-decoration: none; opacity: 0.9; }
  .dmg-btn--outline {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .dmg-meta {
    font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.8px;
  }

  /* Disclosure */
  .disclosure-box {
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    background: var(--color-bg-sunken);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .disclosure-label {
    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .disclosure-box p {
    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Phases */
  .install-phase {
    padding: 88px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .phase-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .phase-header-num {
    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .phase-time {
    font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 2px 8px;
    clip-path: polygon(6px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 6px), calc(100% - 6px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 6px);
  }
  .install-phase h2 {
    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }
  .install-lead {
    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    max-width: 780px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }

  /* Step blocks */
  .step-block { margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .step-badge-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .step-badge {
    flex: 0 0 44px;
    height: 44px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-bg);
    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 22px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    clip-path: polygon(8px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 8px), calc(100% - 8px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 8px);
  }
  .step-block h3 {
    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 26px;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .step-desc {
    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.45;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  /* Terminal */
  .cm-terminal {
    margin: 14px 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    clip-path: polygon(10px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 10px), calc(100% - 10px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 10px);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cm-terminal-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    background: var(--color-terminal-chrome);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .cm-terminal-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .cm-terminal-title {
    font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    margin-left: 8px;
  }
  .cm-terminal-body {
    background: var(--color-terminal-bg);
    padding: 14px 18px;
    font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-terminal-text);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .t-comment { color: var(--color-text-dim); font-style: italic; }
